   MATERIALS.

10. TERMINATION AND REINSTATEMENT.
   (a) Rights under this license terminate automatically for anyone who
       breaches it.
   (b) If the breach is cured within thirty days of becoming aware of it and
       the copyright holder is notified, the license is reinstated as of the
       date of cure.
   (c) The copyright holder may refuse reinstatement for unauthorised
